<StaticPage title="Privacy policy" deck="How this OGCTV website handles information." eyebrow="Legal" updated="6 October 2026"><h2>Current data collection</h2><p>The public website does not currently use advertising trackers or paid analytics. Server infrastructure may record standard technical logs such as IP address, requested page, browser information and time of request for security and reliability.</p><h2>Messages and tips</h2><p>When you contact OGCTV through WhatsApp, your message is handled under WhatsApp’s own terms and privacy practices. Do not send information that could put you or another person in danger. Contacting the newsroom does not by itself create a confidential source relationship.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>Public pages do not require cookies. The protected newsroom uses a strictly necessary, HTTP-only session cookie for authenticated staff. It is not used for advertising.</p><h2>Embedded media</h2><p>Future articles may embed video from providers such as YouTube or Vimeo. Those services may receive technical information when the player loads. OGCTV uses privacy-enhanced YouTube embeds where supported.</p><h2>Your questions</h2><p>Until a dedicated privacy email is formally established, privacy questions can be sent to the verified newsroom WhatsApp number on the contact page.</p></StaticPage>
